  "content_index": 0,
  "text": "The concept of inverse document frequency (IDF) was first proposed by Karen Sparck Jones in 1972. While the term \"tf-idf\" as a combined weighting scheme is often attributed to later work, the foundational idea of IDF as a term weighting measure dates back to Sparck Jones's 1972 paper.",
